Package: i2pchat
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: i2pd
Description: peer-to-peer chat over I2P (Qt client)
 Desktop client for I2PChat. Wire-compatible with 1.4.x peers. Reads the
 same on-disk profiles as the historical Python client.

Package: i2pchat-tui
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: i2pd
Description: peer-to-peer chat over I2P (terminal client)
 FTXUI terminal client. Same core and profile directory as i2pchat.

Package: i2pchat-blindbox-daemon
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: BlindBox replica daemon for I2PChat
 Store-and-forward replica used for offline delivery. Emits an audit.log
 that fail2ban can consume.
